# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your real key.
# NEVER commit the real ".env" file to GitHub — only this example file.

# --- Groq (free tier, no credit card needed) ---
# Get a free key at https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- Swapping providers ---
# To use Google Gemini instead:
#   1. pip install langchain-google-genai
#   2. Set GOOGLE_API_KEY here instead
#   3. In chain.py, swap the ChatGroq import/instantiation for
#      ChatGoogleGenerativeAI(model="gemini-1.5-flash") — the rest of the
#      chain (prompt | llm | parser) doesn't care which provider it is.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
